__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"CHANGELOG",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return t}});const t=[{date:'2026-07-17',items:['Presets: tap what you came for (a laptop spot, a pub with AC, just a toilet) and the map filters itself.','One Filters button holds everything, with new filters: type of place, toilet, and outside seating.','Filters no longer hide a place just because nobody has told us about it yet. Your call, with a toggle.','The whole city loads at once and stays smooth. Panning and zooming no longer jump or reload.','Dense areas group into dots that show how many places they hold and take the colour of the coolest place inside; tap one to open it up.','Confirmed air conditioning for thousands of London venues, from official energy certificates.','The search bar and filters ride the keyboard instead of jumping.','Fixed pins drawing slightly away from their real spot when names were shown.']},{date:'2026-07-16',items:['Your edits show up instantly. If one fails to save, it rolls back and tells you.','Place names appear on the map once you zoom in close.','The map shows up to 1,000 places at once, and tapping it puts the keyboard away.','Updates download in the background and ask before restarting the app.','Duplicate venues (same place, slightly different name) merged.','This page: What\u2019s new now lives in Settings.','Send feedback from Settings. Bugs and ideas come straight to us, and we reply.','The map loads places while you drag, not after you stop.','Place names show whenever fewer than ten places are on screen.']},{date:'2026-07-10',items:['Cooling is now two things: what a place has (fan, AC) and how it feels right now.','Toilet details: cleanliness, gender-neutral toilets, period products.','Accessibility: step-free entry and accessible toilets.','Suggest or fix a place\u2019s working hours, day by day.','The map shows where you are. Tap the locate button.','Pins show what a place is: cafe, pub, or hotel, tinted by how cool it runs.','New filters: max americano price, and places that feel cool right now.','Add a place by pasting a Google Maps, Apple Maps, or Citymapper link.','The keyboard no longer traps you in bottom sheets.']},{date:'2026-07-09',items:['First release: the London map with community-logged AC, sockets, Wi-Fi, laptop policy, americano prices, and working hours.']}]},3165,[]);
